/","title":"Śrī Vaiṣṇava-mahimā-gīti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":55,"first_line":"śrī kṛṣṇa chaitanya prabhu dayā kara more","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-pāda-padme Prārthanā"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["śrī kṛṣṇa chaitanya prabhu dayā kara more","tomā vinā ke dayālu jagata mājhāre"],"translation":["O Śrī Kṛṣṇa Chaitanya Mahāprabhu! Be merciful to me. Other than You, who is merciful in this world?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["patita-pāvana-hetu tava avatāra","mo sama patita prabhu nā pāibe āra"],"translation":["You descended to save the fallen souls. O Lord, You will not find another soul as fallen as I."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["hā hā prabhu nityānanda premānanda sukhī","kṛpāvalokana kara āmi baḍa duḥkhī"],"translation":["O Nityānanda! You are overjoyed with divine love. Give me Your merciful glance. I am very sad."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["dayā kara sītā-pati advaita gosāñi","tava kṛpā-bale pāi chaitanya-nitāi"],"translation":["O Advaita Gosāi, Lord of Sītā Ṭhākurāṇī! Be merciful to me. By Your mercy, I will reach Śrī Chaitanya and Nitāi."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["gaura-premamaya-tanu paṇḍit gadādhara","śrīnivāsa haridāsa dayāra sāgara"],"translation":["O Gadādhar Paṇḍit, embodiment of love for Śrī Gaura! O oceans of mercy, Śrīvās Paṇḍit and Hari Dās Ṭhākur!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["hā hā svarūpa sanātana rūpa raghunātha","bhaṭṭa-yuga śrī jīva hā prabhu lokanātha"],"translation":["O Svarūp Dāmodar, Sanātan, Rūpa, Raghunāth Dās, Raghunāth Bhaṭṭa, Gopāl Bhaṭṭa, and Śrī Jīva! O Lokanāth Prabhu!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["dayā kara śrī-āchārya prabhu śrīnivāsa","rāmachandra-saṅga māge narottama dāsa"],"translation":["O Śrīnivās Āchārya Prabhu! Be merciful! Narottam Dās prays for the association of Rāmachandra Kavirāj."],"isLong":false},{"text":["(dayā kara prabhupāda śrī-gaura-prakāśa)","(tava jana kṛpā māge ei adhama dāsa)"],"translation":["O Śrīla Prabhupād, manifestation of Śrī Gaura! Be merciful. This fallen servant prays for the mercy of your associates."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-savarana-sri","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-sri-krishna-1","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-sri-krishna","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/acharyamaharaj/2-savarana-sri-gaura-pada","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-sri-krishna","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-sri-krsna","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/sri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Bhakti Lalita Devi","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bhakti-lalita-devi/bhakti-lalita-devi-savarana-sri-gaura-pada-padme-sri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-doya-koro-more","personSlug":"bhakti-lalita-devi"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-pāda-padme-Prārthanā-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/shri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-daya-kara-more/","description":"Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-pāda-padme Prārthanā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Sāvaraṇa-Śrī-Gaura-pāda-p